<main class="sheet">
    <div class="brand">Collapse<br />Technologies</div>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 28 September 2026.</p>
    <p>Age-related requirements vary by region and may apply to app access or significant updates. On supported iOS versions, Trust uses Apple’s Declared Age Range and PermissionKit flows when Apple signals that an age check or approval is required. Trust does not ask for a birth date in its normal app flow, and it does not send or store an Apple age range on its servers. A required system flow may be unavailable on older operating systems. Trust has not designed parent-managed accounts for children under 13; age eligibility and availability depend on applicable requirements. A parent or guardian can withdraw consent through Apple. When Trust receives and verifies an Apple consent-withdrawal notice, Trust deletes the linked Trust account and its data and permanently blocks relinking that withdrawn app transaction. The current implementation has no consent-restoration path. Apple may also prevent the child from launching the app until its requirements are met.</p>
    <p>Trust is for the people you choose to share with, including family. You decide who can Look, and you can remove someone. A Look is one peek of where they are now, and they are notified. Location stays sealed until then, unless you share Always. Pause and Stop are yours to set.</p>
    <p>Plus is optional and belongs to your account. A friend's Plus does not cover you. Look, Pause, and Home / Away / Hidden stay free. We do not sell location and we do not run ads.</p>
    <p>Plus is an optional auto-renewing Apple subscription. Payment is charged to your Apple ID. The subscription renews unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel in Settings → Apple ID → Subscriptions. Family Sharing of the subscription is off. Plus on your account unlocks Always, live map pins, 20 people, and 30 days of history.</p>
    <p>The service is provided as-is. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@collapsetechnologies.com">hello@collapsetechnologies.com</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/Privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/Support">Support</a></p>
</main>
